  m_Name: SecondRespawn
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NarratorEventData
  eventID: SecondRespawn
  dialogueLines:
  - "Seriously? You\u2019re back again?! No. Time to reset."
  - You came back to this? After all that? Absolutely not. Reset.
  - The player has returned to the same object. Oh, come on. Time to start over.
  - You again? The narrator remembers what happened last time. Resetting.
  - "The player really came back for more. No. We\u2019re not doing this again."
  - Back to the same object? After everything? Fine. Time for another reset.
  - "The narrator knows exactly what you\u2019re trying to do. Not this time. Reset."
  - "Seriously, you\u2019re back here again? The narrator has had enough. Back you
    go."
  - The player has returned to the scene of their previous mistake. The narrator
    is not allowing a repeat.
  - "Oh, you\u2019re back. The narrator knows where this is going. Resetting now."
  canRepeat: 1
